      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i feel like i've already lost way more than what a banana is gonna fix. the cramps are really intense and i feel lightheaded. if i just take the 2000mg once, won't that be way more effective at stopping the cramps than waiting for a drink to kick in? i really just want to get the levels back up immediately so i can recover.",
