      "content": "it's not that bad though, i'm not saying i'm dying, just really drained. i really dont want to go to the er if i can avoid it, it's a whole thing. i read online that people use potassium for cramping all the time. if i just split the dose up and take 500mg every 15 mins instead of all at once, is that actually safe enough to stop the cramps right now? i just need to get through the evening.",
